# Manually Build a Login Flow
## Logging People In
#### Invoking the Login Dialog and Setting the Redirect URL
```
https://www.facebook.com/v25.0/dialog/oauth?client_id={app-id}
&redirect_uri={redirect-uri}
&state={state-param}
```

`redirect_uri`. Verify the **Valid OAuth redirect URIs** in the **Client OAuth Settings** section. This parameter should be used for preventing [Cross-site Request Forgery⁠](https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FCross-site_request_forgery&h=AUCsEVvPgMBMcMai26j1q3uc8dtRGLkPK0REmqeUNSlB5qR7hIbvX9itdS69FvJmp0gp-BE48-X3DribO2bLLmIawO-YTgrThfsauD8XUF07T2wY3ZKzG0AP2ZRzU6ZHA5EAGwaW4VhzIw) and will be passed back to you, unchanged, in your redirect URI.

```
https://www.facebook.com/v25.0/dialog/oauth?client_id={app-id}
&redirect_uri={"https://www.domain.com/login"}
&state={"{st=state123abc,ds=123456789}"}
```

## Confirming Identity
#### Exchanging Code for an Access Token
```
GET https://graph.facebook.com/v25.0/oauth/access_token?client_id={app-id}
&redirect_uri={redirect-uri}
&client_secret={app-secret}
&code={code-parameter}
```

## Re-asking for Declined Permissions
```
https://www.facebook.com/v25.0/dialog/oauth?client_id={app-id}
&redirect_uri={redirect-uri}
&auth_type=rerequest
scope=email
```
